cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper.
title: "Beyond the Semicircle: reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation accompanying the paper "Beyond the Semicircle: Free Diffusion
  Models with Prescribed Equilibria" and its extended version.  Implements the forward free
  Ornstein-Uhlenbeck flow and its spectral marginals, the reverse-time free SDE and probability
  flow, free denoising score matching, the free functional inequalities, the design of
  prescribed equilibria with state-dependent volatility, and the thirteen numerical experiments
  reported in the papers.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous Authors"
keywords:
  - free probability
  - denoising diffusion
  - free Brownian motion
  - free Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process
  - free entropy
  - conjugate variable
  - Dyson Brownian motion
  - free Wasserstein distance
  - displacement convexity
  - score matching
  - random matrices
